  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Climate &amp; Conflict Resilient Livelihoods for Rural Communities in Wadi ElKu, N Darfur</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project funded by DFID as UKAM will be supporting 35,600 people in North Darfur to restore environment and livelihood, increase agricultural productivity and water access and maintain a resilient life that mitigating climate change in the area.</narrative>
